{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Wildest Casino \u2014 Solo or in Co-op</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/7f6a41cbaba63a6ca4ae4e392e3168e4.poster.avif?t=1763566182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/7f6a41cbaba63a6ca4ae4e392e3168e4.webm?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/7f6a41cbaba63a6ca4ae4e392e3168e4.mp4?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Ever dreamed of running a casino where anything can happen? From fancy VIPs to vandals starting fires, every day brings hilarious problems to solve. Build, expand, and survive the chaos \u2014 alone or with friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Repair and Maintain Your Casino</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/9452a057cab778dafc94906515ef6a40.poster.avif?t=1763566182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/9452a057cab778dafc94906515ef6a40.webm?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/9452a057cab778dafc94906515ef6a40.mp4?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When chaos hits, grab your wrench and get to work. Fix smoking slot machines, replace busted parts, and keep the gamblers spinning.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Lavish Casino</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/86a5297de049dbc8c3fc804971ea0163.poster.avif?t=1763566182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/86a5297de049dbc8c3fc804971ea0163.webm?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/86a5297de049dbc8c3fc804971ea0163.mp4?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>It\u2019s not just about gambling. Add bars, snacks, entertainment, and quirky extras to keep guests spending longer. Design every detail \u2014 from glittering halls to shady backrooms \u2014 and turn your venue into the hottest spot in town.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hilarious Challenges</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/22e0a0ffb1e7d7ba84744a78c2ac9d39.poster.avif?t=1763566182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/22e0a0ffb1e7d7ba84744a78c2ac9d39.webm?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/22e0a0ffb1e7d7ba84744a78c2ac9d39.mp4?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>Not every guest is here to play nice. Deal with troublemakers \u2014 from vandals and graffiti artists to careless smokers turning slot machines into fire hazards. Every day brings unpredictable (and hilarious) new situations for you to handle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Co-op for Shared Success</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/a2d680f55e4734c1cfb21b16b7d5915c.poster.avif?t=1763566182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/a2d680f55e4734c1cfb21b16b7d5915c.webm?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/a2d680f55e4734c1cfb21b16b7d5915c.mp4?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Why run a casino alone when you can share the chaos? Jump into co-op with friends \u2014 assign roles, divide tasks, and laugh your way through fires, vandals, and demanding VIPs as you grow your empire together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/43e4665fd3eae3e0a2d76cb872ca3b2d.poster.avif?t=1763566182\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/43e4665fd3eae3e0a2d76cb872ca3b2d.webm?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/43e4665fd3eae3e0a2d76cb872ca3b2d.mp4?t=1763566182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412160?t=1763566182","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412160?t=1763566182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/840320e51b434314d450a3a28fa3d5e4a26fcfc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763566182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/840320e51b434314d450a3a28fa3d5e4a26fcfc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763566182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full contr